{"id":"2b9ad13208d107d7","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-witness.md","title":"Witness","display":"df-witness — Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-witness","aliases":["58-df-witness","Witness"],"display":"df-witness — Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-witness</span><span>Witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-witness — Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> (typed satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignment predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Witness}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Witness}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Witness}_S(a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land s(x)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Witness}_S(a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land s(x)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}witness\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Witness}_{\\mathcal M}(a,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{Witness}_S(a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}witness\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Witness}_{\\mathcal M}(a,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{Witness}_S(a,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>存在量词的满足子句与类型实现是使用本定义的后续事实，不再作为第二、第三个定义混入。</li>\n<li>见证关系显式选择同一结构/语言的满足递归与赋值，并把唯一可能的自由变元约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；不再依赖未定义的元记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[a/x]\">\\(\\varphi[a/x]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Henkin witness: in countable languages, complete theory has countable model by witness method</li>\n<li>Skolem witness: function symbol added for each existential; Skolem hull gives elementary substructure</li>\n<li>Types: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\in S_n(\\mathcal{M})\">\\(p \\in S_n(\\mathcal{M})\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-type realized by tuple <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{a}\">\\(\\bar{a}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p = \\mathrm{tp}(\\bar{a}/\\mathcal{M})\">\\(p = \\mathrm{tp}(\\bar{a}/\\mathcal{M})\\)</span></li>\n<li>Omitting types: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is not realized by any model extending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic</li>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":